R11 | internal/services/device_service.go:389-394 | Q4: `Render(d models.Device, short bool)` branches on `short` immediately at the top; the two branches share no code — one returns `d.ID+" "+d.Status` inline, the other delegates to the unrelated Summarize() (lines 280-302) | Split Flag Argument — into `Render(d)` and `RenderShort(d)` | S
```

